  "description": "The GSLB virtual server **gslb_vs1** (currently updated to **gslb_vs1_new**) is configured for the domain **example.com**, using an IPv4 address space with a netmask of **255.255.255.0** and a corresponding IPv6 prefix length of **64**. DNS records are of type **A**, and the server advertises the cookie domain **.example.com** with a cookie timeout of **180\u202fseconds**. Application flow logging is **ENABLED**, while the EC\u2011S feature is turned **ON** (ECS\u202f=\u202fENABLED) but EC\u2011S address validation is **DISABLED**. The server\u2019s name service (CNAME) handling is **ENABLED**, and the server name resolved is **server1.example.com**. The virtual server operates in **REQUEST** mode and is classified as a **GSLB** type, with a TTL of **30\u202fseconds** for DNS responses.\n\nLoad\u2011balancing is performed with a primary method of **LEASTCONNECTION** and a backup method of **ROUNDROBIN**. The server carries **3** active services out of a total of **5**, each assigned a weight of **50** and a dynamic weight policy of **SERVICEWEIGHT**. If the primary goes down, the setting **disableprimaryondown** remains **DISABLED**, and the backup virtual server **backup_vs1** (IP **192.168.2.10**) will take over after a backup session timeout of **300\u202fseconds**. Persistence is configured as **SOURCEIP** (ID\u202f=\u202f100) with a persistence mask of **255.255.0.0**, and site persistence is set to **NONE**. The server applies the policy **policy_vs1** with priority **10**, evaluating the rule `HTTP.REQ.URL.CONTAINS(\"/api\")`. Persistence for site\u2011origin (SOP) is **ENABLED**, with a timeout of **120\u202fseconds**, a threshold of **5**, and the site\u2011origin method based on **HEALTH**. Backup actions for site\u2011origin are set to **DROP**, and the server does not use mirroring (MIR\u202f=\u202fDISABLED). Node\u2011default bindings are **NO**, and the server will not consider effective state beyond **NONE**.\n\nOperationally the virtual server is **UP** and its health metric reads **1** (status\u202f=\u202f1). The current state is **ENABLED**, having last changed at **2021\u201106\u201101\u202f12:30:00** (Unix time **1622547800000\u202fms**), with **1\u202f,000** ticks since that change. The server\u2019s overall status is **ENABLED**, with a tolerance of **20**, a timeout of **60\u202fseconds**, and a site\u2011domain TTL of **60\u202fseconds**. The configuration also records that the server is part of a non\u2011CNAME (ISCNAME) enabled setup, and the application\u2011delivery\u2011routing (EDR) feature is **ENABLED**. Finally, the server binds to IP **10.0.0.1** on port **80**, and the default go\u2011to\u2011priority expression is **DEFAULT**.",
